$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=-1$ and the corresponding eigenvectors are the columns of the matrix $P:$\n\n$\\,$ ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,{v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351641 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351641 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351641 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0838f7e1-1e2a-5de4-899d-0534f10f1b2b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351718 #edb/ref 1080 "$[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]$ and $[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}]$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351718 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351718 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "121c30d3-381d-5eec-812d-224e51ec2ed5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351722 #edb/ref 1080 "$[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351722 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351722 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "123147cc-29a9-5a9b-8197-5141287824db" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351733 #edb/ref 1080 "$[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ and $[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351733 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351733 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "13590b66-311d-5d93-824a-b8885d95a619" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351944 #edb/ref 1080 "$[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]$ and $[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351944 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351944 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "28b0ed5c-9277-577c-b0f4-46d45ce08e7f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352262 #edb/ref 1080 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{aligned}]" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352262 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 175921860454